# Base URL of the @ocular/backend Cloudflare Worker.
#
# Omit this entirely and the app talks to the deployed worker, which is what you
# want for a production build. Copy this file to .env.local and uncomment the
# line below to develop against a local `wrangler dev` instead.
#
# Note there is no Firebase config here: a Firebase web apiKey is a public client
# identifier rather than a secret, so it lives in src/firebase.js.

# VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8787
